 A single key (or array of keys) that should be parsed as `Boolean`s.
 
+#### options.count
+Type: `Array|String`<br>
+Default: `[]`
+
+A single key (or array of keys) whose value is the number of times it was given. Aliases share the same count.
+
+```js
+mri(['-vvv'], { count: 'v' });
+//=> { _:[], v:3 }
+
+mri(['--verbose', '--verbose'], { count: 'verbose' });
+//=> { _:[], verbose:2 }
+```
+
